Now you can scan through life with the Skenicash app.

Use the Skenicash app to:
- Scan your QR code;
- Receive proof of scans;
- Check all merchant locations;
- See raffle results and prizes;
- Receive Golden Eggs to win prizes;
- Receive broadcast messages and Skenideals;
- Complete your Skenicash profile in the app to receive free raffle seats.

You can signup by using your Skenicash card QR-code.

Skenicash is a product of Bravobit.
